{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighted Dice is a fast party game where 3 to 6 friends fight for their survival against a giant magic die while betting on their fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your quick reflexes and skill to survive, or outsmart your competition with strategic betting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local and online multiplayer</strong> with up to 6 players in private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many interesting bets that will change the rules of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls with deep and hard to master mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support, for up to 6 controllers on the same computer, or up to two players on keyboard</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118100?t=1766878524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118100?t=1766878524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118100/6108503584ea9e2c02cf4f7a8dddc0f3258c6c92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766878524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118100/6108503584ea9e2c02cf4f7a8dddc0f3258c6c92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766878524","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weighted Dice is a fast party game where 3 to 6 friends fight for their surviva